{
  "text": "Welcome! I'm Kelsey Blevins, and here is something that most sellers don't realize. The way your home is presented to the market makes all the difference. And every single home I list gets my full effort, attention, and strategy. So, here are a few things I bring to the table that most agents simply do not. I've partnered with a top tier media team to showcase homes in a way that stops the scroll, resulting in millions of views. I am also a monthly homes .com premium member, so all my listings get premium placement on all major sites, and constant retargeting ads to buyers who've already seen your home online. Because 2014 marketing will not get you 2026 buyers. I have helped over 100 families sell their home, and I've sold over 40 million dollars in real estate just two years into my career. I am currently ranked number two in the Kataba Valley Association of Realtors amongst thousands of amazing agents. If you've made it to the end of this video, you're probably at least curious about what your property is worth, or you're seriously considering selling. Either way, I'd love to have a conversation with you about how we can make that happen together.",
